      "answer": "A",
      "reason_rejected": "Elaborate burials are not securely documented before the Middle Paleolithic/Neanderthal period and certainly not before AMH in a widespread, 'elaborate' sense comparable to the deep antiquity of stone tools."
    },
    {
      "answer": "B",
      "reason_rejected": "Larger sites with larger populations (sedentism) are characteristic of the Epipaleolithic/Neolithic transition, which is much later than the emergence of AMH and the Upper Paleolithic."
